  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Reapers are proficient with light armor and shields, but not tower shields. A reaper suffers from arcane spell failure chance as normal for her arcane spells, but also suffers from arcane spell failure chance on spells sourced from a primal-seeded soulsown if she's wearing metal armor.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/the-reaper#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
